  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multiprofile setups (e.g., config_002, 005) outperform singleprofile (config_001) and scvi_n200 encoders (config_005) beat PCA (config_002). This experiment tests scvi_n200 in singleprofile (config_004), directly comparing encoder impact across profile settings. It clarifies whether scvi_n200's benefits (observed in multiprofile) generalize to singleprofile, isolating the encoder's role. This reduces uncertainty about critical design choices under limited budget."  
